note bottom of PUC
  **Full Traceability Chain**
  1. PUML diagram (src/puml/*.puml)
     ↓ PumlUnitConverter.pumlParse()
  2. PumlClass[] (in-memory)
     ↓ PumlUnitConverter.m3UnitsCreate()
  3. MDAv4/M3/CLASS/*.unit (JSON scenario)
     ↓ UnitDiscoveryService.tsUnitCreate()
  4. {component}/src/ts/layer2/*.ts.unit
     ↓ origin IOR
  5. {component}/src/ts/layer2/*.ts (source)

  Bidirectional: step 3↔4 via references[]
end note

